              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bo muvukana canke muri bene nyoko, canke mu bahungu banyu canke mu bakobga banyu, canke mu bagore banyu mupfumbatirana, canke mu bakunzi banyu b’amagara, muri ben’ abo ni hagira uwo yosha muri mwebge mu mpisho, ati Tugende dusabe izindi mana; (kand’ ar’ izo mutigeze kumenya, mwe na ba sogokuruza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:7"
          },
