          "text": "Kandi mukoranye amasahu yose yo muri co, muyarunde mu kibuga caho, muturire ico gisagara n’amasahu yaco yose, bibe nk’ikimazi co kwoswa ciramvuriye, gishikaniwe Uhoraho Imana yanyu; ico gisagara kize gihinduke ikigūngūzi c’amasakamburira ibihe vyose: ntikize gisubire kwubakwa ukundi. ",
